18 Major League Baseball season), the MLB season begins on **March 29, 2018**.\n\nHowever, this is about a specific year. Let me check if there's more general information about when the MLB regular season starts. From Paragraph 28 (Opening Day):\n\n- 2011: March 31 (Thursday) or April 1 (Friday)\n- 2012: April 5 (Thursday) or April 6 (Friday)\n- 2013-2017: Monday openers\n- 2018: March 29 (Thursday)\n\nSince the question asks for a general pattern or specific date, and the World Series is the definitive reference point, the answer should be based on the 2018 season which is the most recent detailed information provided.\n\nANSWER: **The regular season of the American League (where the New York Yankees, the team with the most World Series titles, play) begins on March 29, 2018** (or more generally in March, with the specific date varying by year).","time":{"start":1777646714325,"end":1777646714325}}}
